       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-RMAN-ASSEM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RMAN-ASSEM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MICROPOLYGON-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SKINNING-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BXDF-SPECULAR-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHADING-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHADING-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-RMAN-ASSEM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PRN-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PRN-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MICRO-AND-SKIN.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BXDF-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PRN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MICRO-AND-SKIN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MICROPOLYGON-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SKINNING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BXDF-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BXDF-SPECULAR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHADING-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PRN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MICROPOLYGON-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SKINNING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-BXDF-SPECULAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SHADING-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SHADING-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PRN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PRN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PRN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PRN-CODE.
